(property "Verification" "User confirmed momentary normally-open, hold-to-start, software-off, startup-only operation on 2026-10-05. External panel momentary normally-open START contact pair, wired to J51. Hold until controller energizes M16, then release. A maintained contact left closed prevents software total-power cutoff. Button starts power; pressing it while M16 is holding does not request shutdown. Image gives22mm mounting diameter and16A250VAC; exact DC/inrush rating, terminal assignment, body depth and indicator voltage are unqualified. Indicator is not connected in this design. No PCB-mounted switch body." (at 256.54 154.94 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes)))
