(property "Verification" "JST XH 2.50mm PCB male header; short cable connection selected by user. Motherboard mate XHP-2 + SXH-001T-P0.6. Use the actual UPS supplied mating plug on the UPS end; vendor phrase XH2.54 is not the PCB pitch specification. Existing pin-to-net allocation retained; qualify cable polarity and total current. Panel START contact only, not a fifth UPS port. Momentary normally-open button parallels M16 COM/NO; carries startup current. Placed in the rear connector bank, clear of the airflow corridor." (at 256.54 113.03 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes)))
